say after World War II,

00:00:04.671 --> 00:00:07.107 align:start size:94% position:6%
there was a very, very
strong impulse in America,

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:10.110 align:start size:97% position:3%
and across Europe to say,
"Look, Liberalism is all we,

00:00:10.110 --> 00:00:11.745
it's all we need
people, you know,

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.114
private people will
make the decisions

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:17.183 align:start size:84% position:16%
about where the
guardrails should be,

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:18.818
what the constraints should be.

00:00:21.821 --> 00:00:24.024
maybe that made sense to
a lot of people, then.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:27.894 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think at this point, we've
reached the point where,

00:00:27.894 --> 00:00:30.363 align:start size:94% position:6%
