00:32:24.876 --> 00:32:26.210
I know the Jewish tradition,

00:32:26.210 --> 00:32:27.845
which is like 3,000 years old,

00:32:27.845 --> 00:32:29.714 align:start size:94% position:6%
then I know this
Anglo-American tradition,

00:32:29.714 --> 00:32:32.116
which is about 1,000 years old.

00:32:32.116 --> 00:32:35.954
And what's really clear when
