00:33:01.980 --> 00:33:03.481
I mean, people know that there,

00:33:03.481 --> 00:33:06.017
I think most people
probably know that

00:33:06.017 --> 00:33:08.619
in the 1600s, 1640s, there was

00:33:10.655 --> 00:33:12.457 align:start size:84% position:16%
a revolution, a
