00:33:14.325 --> 00:33:15.893
They tried to have a Republic,

00:33:17.895 --> 00:33:20.264
to revise the English
constitution that went

00:33:20.264 --> 00:33:23.034
on for 15 years or something.

00:33:25.503 --> 00:33:27.872 align:start size:84% position:16%
And it didn't work,
it didn't work.

00:33:27.872 --> 00:33:29.507
They kept changing
